# Testing Rules

For critical behavior, choose the appropriate level:

Unit:
- validation
- mappers
- utilities
- business rules

Integration:
- services
- forms
- important components
- API interactions

E2E:
- authentication
- critical CRUD flows
- authorization
- search/filter
- language switching (next-intl locale change)

Before completing a feature:
- run TypeScript checks
- run lint
- run tests relevant to the change
- run build when practical
- verify loading/error/empty states
- verify responsive behavior
- verify accessibility
- verify next-intl (keys present, no hardcoded user-visible strings in touched UI)
- check for regressions
